WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.854
Tap Listen, and Michael reads the chapter aloud, highlighting each verse as he goes.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.702
Tap the down arrow to tuck the player away.

00:00:24.702 --> 00:00:30.274
Michael keeps reading while you use the rest of the app, and even when your screen is locked.

00:00:31.076 --> 00:00:37.115
If you'd rather read at your own pace, tap Scroll, and the page moves gently by itself.

00:00:37.115 --> 00:00:40.655
Use the plus and minus buttons to change the speed.
